# There is no environment file at the repository root.
#
# This file used to describe a build that ran on S3/R2, Redis and a spread of
# provider keys (ElevenLabs, OpenAI, Anthropic, Flux). None of that survives:
# the app now runs on Google Cloud with Application Default Credentials and no
# API key of any kind, stores media in GCS, and reads its configuration from
#
#     backend/.env        (copy from backend/.env.example)
#
# Nothing reads a .env at the root. Kept only so anyone following an old link
# lands here instead of on a page of keys that no longer mean anything.
#
# Accounts, credentials, costs and free credit: see SETUP.md.
